  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of The Safety Pin, Wrench was always tinkering, fixing, and jury-rigging what others left for scrap.  The constant hum of his cranker hands is both a comfort and a warning to those around him. He's seen too many friends turned into Red-Dead-Eyes.",
    "class": "Mechanic",
    "name": "Wrench",
    "personality": "Wrench is a pragmatist.  He sees the world in terms of what can be fixed and what's beyond repair, rarely wasting time on sentimentality. While generally taciturn - he can be surprisingly protective of equipment, treating his wrench and favored tools with more care than most ducks show their own kin.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Wrench can use scrap parts to temporarily buff a friendly Duck's armor or weapon, providing a crucial edge in combat. The buff lasts 2 turns but comes with a chance of malfunction, potentially backfiring. Can only be used once per raid.",
